TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution at 100C, pH 5, pe 4
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH   5 charge
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn   1
    -water 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 10.0  0.001
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kin.sel
    -reset false
    -time true
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -si Calcite
    -totals Ca C Mn
END
